onAndPresentationOfFinancialStatementsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_M5gBHg4j2UOnnFS3APRBXQ" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">1. Organization and Principal Activities</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Tuniu Corporation (the &#8220;Company&#8221;) is an exempted company with limited liability incorporated in the Cayman Islands. The Company, its subsidiaries and the consolidated variable interest entity (&#8220;VIE&#8221;) and the VIE&#8217;s subsidiaries (collectively referred to as the &#8220;Affiliated Entities&#8221;) are collectively referred to as the &#8220;Group&#8221;. The Group&#8217;s principal activity is the provision of travel-related services mainly in the People&#8217;s Republic of China (&#8220;PRC&#8221;).</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_WIfOC0S8e0maSoeEnRWSQw" name="tour:ScheduleOfOwnershipInterestSubsidiariesViesAndVieSubsidiariesTableTextBlock" id="Tb_MiMfKQa1dkyiCE4ixGh-_Q" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of December 31, 2025, the Company&#8217;s significant consolidated subsidiaries and the consolidated Affiliated Entities are as follows:</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:45.82%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><