ion></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.01%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.87%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_LY5SbL077UuXzIvTBWGN_g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_YbCFQ_bWu02uoN-a8GX8kw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermInvestments" scale="3" id="Tc_i0P8QKCjFkGtC3TDJL6gWg_8_6">32,462</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 18pt;">Equity investments - equity method</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In December 2016, Nanjing Zhongshan Financial Leasing Co., Ltd. (&#8220;Zhongshan&#8221;) was established and the Group invested RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2016_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_NanjingZhongshanFinancialLeasingCoLtdMember_e9wClOfCREiRrIhQu5u11w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_2NzCYLVjk0SFDovqdXIpQQ">42,500</ix:nonFraction> for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_HWvhQR0-ukSb-U3gHiU3bg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2016_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_NanjingZhongshanFinancialLeasingCoLtdMember_e9wClOfCREiRrIhQu5u11w" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_PQhwFiRd-UWhjKZMrsynMg">25</ix:nonFraction>% of equity interest in Zhongshan. This investment was accounted for as an equity-method investment because the Group has significant influence over the operating and financial policies of Zhongshan as the Group has <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_Mcobd9vECE6Vrfd7yh_00g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_NanjingZhongshanFinancialLeasingCoLtdMember_M9shnmZ5v0SXjn8lOHAYlA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="tour:NumberOfDirectorsHavingSignificantInfluence" scale="0" id="Narr_uHCe8cAsnky6NzfBoLmfpA"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_Mcobd9vECE6Vrfd7yh_00g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_NanjingZhongshanFinancialLeasingCoLtdMember_kHC64-HidUeVkVRWufm94Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="tour:NumberOfDirectorsHavingSignificantInfluence" scale="0" id="Narr_h4Sog8hv8UK8Mh77Dhm4sQ">one</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> of the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_Mcobd9vECE6Vrfd7yh_00g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_dei_LegalEntityAxis_tour_NanjingZhongshanFinancialLeasingCoLtdMember_9ERE8B6r00-Uhtq14kPZAw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="tour:NumberOfDirectorsHavingSignificantInfluence" scale="0" id="Narr_ebyubRIvKEyuQ_HBFS6sqg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_Mcobd9vECE6Vrfd7yh_00g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_dei_LegalEntityAxis_tour_NanjingZhongshanFinancialLeasingCoLtdMember_yKbHpGoLD0-b2xClFCm0wg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="tour:NumberOfDirectorsHavingSignificantInfluence" scale="0" id="Narr_3uZnqgrMcka8hf3naXB3Qw">five</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> board seats of Zhongshan. As of December 31, 2024 and 2025, the carrying value of its equity investment was RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_NanjingZhongshanFinancialLeasingCoLtdMember_WRiX3XrhtESlQbKI89RFXg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_qg9KLPV810SvEV7xKtTbAQ">46,937</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_NanjingZhongshanFinancialLeasingCoLtdMember_hAO081LEgESk1LN5nAPWeg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_XC3KnCX-JUGxKRNxTZ_2jA">42,500</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As disclosed in Note 4, during the year ended December 31, 2022, the Group disposed the controlling interests in certain subsidiaries and only retained non-controlling interests in the former subsidiaries after the disposals, and recognized an investment of RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_RetainedNonControllingInvestmentsInDisposedTravelAgenciesMember__k4mHu-T_kSFixXV1SLydQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentsFairValueDisclosure" scale="3" id="Narr_RmLpWNI3f0myJu2WQ0hjLQ">9,655</ix:nonFraction> at fair value. Since the Group is still entitled to appoint one board seat to each of former subsidiaries, the Group is considered to be able to exert significant influence over their operating and financial policies so the retained noncontrolling investments are measured under equity method. As of December 31, 2024 and 2025, the carrying value of these equity investments was RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_RetainedNonControllingInvestmentsInDisposedTravelAgenciesMember_DGBi8YV38EGhJU9bu8z37g" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_FKp2GUXTRE6Tnj89OYJcEA">7,001</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_RetainedNonControllingInvestmentsInDisposedTravelAgenciesMember_HL-21A9g-kyHEF9ZcW6ZAg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_AD_3qR4xt0KIS1qUYPsLbA">7,660</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In June 2023, Guangxi Yijianyou Tourism Operation Co., Ltd. (&#8220;Yijianyou&#8221;) was established and the Group invested RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_GuangxiYijianyouTourismOperationCoLtdYijianyoMember_tAuqEkwjJ0KLoLKXLtI0Kw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireEquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_S6JUdLkTLUSmNyy-HQitFg">1,050</ix:nonFraction> for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_HWvhQR0-ukSb-U3gHiU3bg" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_GuangxiYijianyouTourismOperationCoLtdYijianyoMember_SmsTxe9eLEOAeKyQwpCq4A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_qy5D7fdYA0WnzhUYYG7vaw">35</ix:nonFraction>% of equity interest in Yijianyou. This investment was accounted for as an equity-method investment because the Group has significant influence over the operating and financial policies of Yijianyou as the Group has <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_Mcobd9vECE6Vrfd7yh_00g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_GuangxiYijianyouTourismOperationCoLtdYijianyoMember_SHYCxhAOXU23rYELCmXkbQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="tour:NumberOfDirectorsHavingSignificantInfluence" scale="0" id="Narr_bYVKRcLv_EWyxZq50oXsVg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_Mcobd9vECE6Vrfd7yh_00g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_GuangxiYijianyouTourismOperationCoLtdYijianyoMember_YfI_R82F4Um2BQFKwZiJpw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="tour:NumberOfDirectorsHavingSignificantInfluence" scale="0" id="Narr_S0LESZXgaUuh4MzadpTjag">one</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> of the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_Mcobd9vECE6Vrfd7yh_00g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_dei_LegalEntityAxis_tour_GuangxiYijianyouTourismOperationCoLtdYijianyoMember_-3QVmgbQHEaEmBAfpiiR2g" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="tour:NumberOfDirectorsHavingSignificantInfluence" scale="0" id="Narr_ZyoGAFMpyUqFlysJf092HQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_Mcobd9vECE6Vrfd7yh_00g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_dei_LegalEntityAxis_tour_GuangxiYijianyouTourismOperationCoLtdYijianyoMember_ama7o0DRekyNGuEXkfaUxA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="tour:NumberOfDirectorsHavingSignificantInfluence" scale="0" id="Narr_bYjDyVtwWE2_NWt-zAHwkw">three</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> board seats of Yijianyou. As of December 31, 2024 and 2025, the carrying value of its equity investment was RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_GuangxiYijianyouTourismOperationCoLtdYijianyoMember_FS1cLy0B1kmHgSdbhk1-pw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_BDH98r3e0kSybytvxCJN-w">2,381</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_GuangxiYijianyouTourismOperationCoLtdYijianyoMember_BtyyE3BX4UqXAj0Cl-ih3w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_I_bVj6s69kqMajmy0Ipj8Q">2,423</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the year ended December 31, 2023, the Group recognized RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_NanjingZhongshanFinancialLeasingCoLtdMember_FoyL3UjTJUi56lCCc2EImA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_pmQ7VtUVmEm-_ZaNf_aumA">580</ix:nonFraction> of shares of loss of equity investees and during the years ended December 31, 2024 and 2025, the Group recognized RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_NanjingZhongshanFinancialLeasingCoLtdMember_M9shnmZ5v0SXjn8lOHAYlA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_yjO4YFWBIkORZ6e2FARJUg">1,486</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis_tour_NanjingZhongshanFinancialLeasingCoLtdMember_kHC64-HidUeVkVRWufm94Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:IncomeLossFromEquityMethodInvestments" scale="3" id="Narr_LnCSmltSiEamlZ69B9dHRw">579</ix:nonFraction> of shares of income of equity investees, respectively, from all of its equity method investments. As of December 31, 2024 and 2025, none of the Group&#8217;s equity method investment, neither individually nor in aggregate, was considered as significant under Reg S-X Rules.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Equity investments &#8211; without readily determinable fair values</i></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_WIfOC0S8e0maSoeEnRWSQw" name="us-gaap:EquitySecuritiesWithoutReadilyDeterminableFairValueTableTextBlock" id="Tb_57kZ0ARL5EmEJl-A_4PI8Q" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:66.24%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.67%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="