'Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_CWohO9wAdUu5cU9w_28Hzg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" scale="3" id="Tc_2286I8GIH06lBC7vMzHfug_4_2">36</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.59%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_YbCFQ_bWu02uoN-a8GX8kw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" scale="3" id="Tc_0P6gdIiJAUabYlDnAypxIw_4_4">35</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.01%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.87%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_LY5SbL077UuXzIvTBWGN_g" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_YbCFQ_bWu02uoN-a8GX8kw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShortTermBorrowings" scale="3" id="Tc_31KHxdoE9EO1CjQPYgTjxg_4_6">5</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of December 31, 2024 and 2025, the Group had one borrowing from a bank, with interests charged at rates of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_HWvhQR0-ukSb-U3gHiU3bg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_tour_ShortTermBorrowingsMember_h6AGTpbGE0OGsP0uBROcYw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_XMASSb-k2UiUnqVDdDNvIA">10.3</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_HWvhQR0-ukSb-U3gHiU3bg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_tour_ShortTermBorrowingsMember_YF4qlj4xjEW0yy5-nFYmCA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_jw4nV4TzhUuPmej4ZG45ew">9.6</ix:nonFraction>% per annum, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The above borrowing didn&#8217;t contain certain standard covenants including, among others, limitation on payment terms and conditions for funding.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="Tc_PIdmQYs5zUem13_4ybfKiQ_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_3-mBPgbnq0morrAwtdcpvg_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_eL6MVzcEZ0KKGBSVS1Ivqg_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_M7GluQ74h0iAH941w3KwaA_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_hJGmG4qVHU6iDMtM43QbvQ_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_YRMD1E3K_06hHmI3yKuNXw_3_6"></a><a id="Tc_nSE7df1LNECybvIxWKtTQw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_xxUBEYvP-Ue8ZTpbyr-wyw_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_PMJP4d-KhEWQRrLu876v2A_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_6FK0JrQuQkaFU9JaP7YCiQ_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_-WNywRTVgUiwIO2uoiYCbA_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_tZ0XkUnMzE283mSDvPn-rg_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_A_WWw2FLHkWrWHqmJjtMjw_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_R-euesORn0WUNdgyevftfQ_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_hSSUR0zHX02YsVfywoSnKQ_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_3y8JX9dgKU-l8WqGg3neEQ_2_6"></a><a id="Tc_UGwhxfitoE6Tr9BynHwBSA_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_3As44X0nv0iVbLuk8qSDpA_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_jnYFZd1vgk6aaSrdZlLciA_3_6"></a><a id="Tc_kLEntvuqX0ytGozIOU4aKA_3_8"></a><a id="Tc_vjrHmBhE1EOLoexeQcsXJw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_Iaa0UuLdfEm4b9j-YLatuA_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_PHiFVPEkCUCBXHvQpDN24A_5_4"></a><a id="Tc_vUIXjpc2cECH4wXwLKolJA_5_6"></a><a id="Tc_vByWm00p-kiKAfhfNHAbFg_5_8"></a><a id="Tc_bWRQkKRhaUiZ3sdy3EaGiQ_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_ezPahbZIRUaVE904P4rxBg_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_7zU7VtVBDU2MrsAJ9aXMSg_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_AHV46SW6vk-oxmxi-uAXow_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_WEVnUbuVdEaFHUcpYih4UA_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_VPCyJuHiJE6w8n49Bv63pg_4_3"></a><a id="Tc_2U3qXi8JCUG0Rpu5Rb-vHg_4_5"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_WIfOC0S8e0maSoeEnRWSQw" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeasesTextBlock" id="Tb_b--_ciGwRk-TADpQMsA3vw" continuedAt="Tb_b--_ciGwRk-TADpQMsA3vw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">12. Leases</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Group has operating leases primarily for office and operation space. The Group&#8217;s operating lease arrangements have remaining lease terms of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_x2whJFx_u0-eznSq_duWnw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract" id="Narr_hrzy01GHjkKqUlNpmgFjCg">two month</ix:nonNumeric> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MaximumMember_9FXqzraVakGGqhuDwMY8aQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract" id="Narr_9U-ZVi5nk0GggPtP8km_9A">fourteen years</ix:nonNumeric>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Total lease costs were RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_MKzBP10bE0a4L6zTSkr1mQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LeaseCost" scale="3" id="Narr_4OevUsz5AEiNb15JN-0ang">12,511</ix:nonFraction>, RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_Ireyc2Gaz0e4DWbZMpQykA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LeaseCost" scale="3" id="Narr_2mUgCtkHr0a9pzCFlTMdQw">5,233</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_WIfOC0S8e0maSoeEnRWSQw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LeaseCost" scale="3" id="Narr_bIkkQuW_30-X8JLcw-O5LQ">5,461</ix:nonFraction> for the year ended December 31, 2023, 2024 and 2025, respectively including short-term lease costs within 12 months of RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_MKzBP10bE0a4L6zTSkr1mQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShortTermLeaseCost" scale="3" id="Narr_SD_P3uSh4UeCkEEUttN6ag">809</ix:nonFraction>, RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_Ireyc2Gaz0e4DWbZMpQykA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShortTermLeaseCost" scale="3" id="Narr_eEKe8zfRv0OTt8N9EiEF5w">1,699</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_KLlvWlT6dE2YYlR3I7zG2A" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_WIfOC0S8e0maSoeEnRWSQw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShortTermLeaseCost" scale="3" id="Narr_U18NOP_2TUykKjf36d9dbQ">1,996</ix:nonFraction> respectively. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 18pt;">Consolidated balance sheet information related to leases is presented as follows:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_WIfOC0S8e0maSoeEnRWSQw" name="tour:ScheduleOfConsolidatedBalanceSheetInformationRelatedToOperatingLeasesTableTextBlock" id="Tb_MltMNP7QxEiiOlDUMitTHg" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:64.89%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.59%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;