</table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_WIfOC0S8e0maSoeEnRWSQw" name="us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_hPA5DbN7OUOp8mCVxlzTZA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">16. Ordinary Shares</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Upon inception of the Company, each ordinary share was issued at a par value of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_5ND9gXxKaEyB5sPrV5YXrA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_CWohO9wAdUu5cU9w_28Hzg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_P3_obnkF60ySH8LyhXEHJw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_5ND9gXxKaEyB5sPrV5YXrA" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_YbCFQ_bWu02uoN-a8GX8kw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_dgYH6DpZ90-r6Cet6ekNWg">0.0001</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> per share. Various numbers of ordinary shares were issued to share-based compensation award recipients. As of December 31, 2024 and 2025, the authorized share capital of the Company is US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_LY5SbL077UuXzIvTBWGN_g" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_Ireyc2Gaz0e4DWbZMpQykA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="tour:CommonStockValueAuthorized" scale="3" id="Narr_yiEN4q7qjk213nb5in6ZZA"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_LY5SbL077UuXzIvTBWGN_g" c