5_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember_BefLUiz1s0aE4xQLEr346Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OtherLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="3" id="Tc__-1WD9iYa02UoKdEtAIJeg_16_6">140</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_WIfOC0S8e0maSoeEnRWSQw" name="us-gaap:SubsequentEventsTextBlock" id="Tb_lIlUkbX4PEW99Z7TTpOzHA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">22. Subsequent events</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;width:0pt;"></span><span style="display:inline-block;width:0pt;"></span>The Company&#8217;s board of directors approved and declared a cash dividend totaling approximately US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_LY5SbL077UuXzIvTBWGN_g" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_tour_O2026AdividendsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_5aNWsZ_ErUaVka3EK8F8Zw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DividendsPayableCurrentAndNoncurrent" scale="6" id="Narr_lnVermzVxUi7CNpvB7T7uw">13</ix:nonFraction> million. The cash dividend will be payable in U.S. dollars to holders of ordinary shares and of ADSs of record as of the close of business on <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_tour_O2026AdividendsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_QQdAEWWu0kCB97jwF_wb0A" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:DividendsPayableDateOfRecordDayMonthAndYear" id="Narr_esdNRgVEh0KD2tRqefufPQ">May 4, 2026</ix:nonNumeric>, U.S. Eastern Time. The dividend to holders of ordinary shares will be US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_5ND9gXxKaEyB5sPrV5YXrA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_tour_O2026AdividendsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_QQdAEWWu0kCB97jwF_wb0A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockDividendsPerShareDeclared" scale="0" id="Narr_LsDjffBDCEKkfrRxtNL0Lw">0.0399</ix:nonFraction> per ordinary share, and expected to be paid on or about <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_DividendsAxis_tour_O2026AdividendsMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_QQdAEWWu0kCB97jwF_wb0A" format="ixt:date-monthname-day-year-en" name="us-gaap:DividendPayableDateToBePaidDayMonthAndYear" id="Narr_qrftUO6AJ0etHTIZNVWetA">May 14, 2026</ix:nonNumeric>. Dividends to holders of ADSs are expected to be paid on or about May 20, 2026 through the depositary bank, subject to the terms of the deposit agreement.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="display:none;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';line-height:0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-50</p></div></div>
